        "fitting": "Tailor the support to the host. Leave required hinge travel and any Kickback flex region clear. Armor may overlap it only where its actual coverage does not bind or obstruct the construction.",
        "working_sequence": "Carries the wing-root action through the body while permitting control. It performs no sensing, lifting or powering by itself.",
