        "earlier": "A generic paired adult and feeding drawer would miss a distinctive source lifecycle.",
        "current": "This fictional Caustic profile uses a compatible identified Bankseed pupa during larval development. The support animal and donor then have different fates and inventory histories.",
        "purpose": "Provides meaningful specialist supply while preserving direct purchase of a ready gland for ordinary racers."
