        "earlier": "A wing name or declared peaceful/ground plan could hide operative flight capability or wrongly ban a passive surface.",
        "current": "Repeated powered support defines the enabled Flyer capability. Hops and passive glide follow the declared ground event policy; a promised lack of use is not physical disabling.",
        "purpose": "Keeps Flyers with Flyers without turning every unusual silhouette into an arbitrary prohibited item."
      },
      {
        "id": "W18.AMEND.12",
        "title": "Missing anatomy documentation is not cured by a grade",
