        "earlier": "A high-labelled wing, sensor or offensive organ can appear to cover several undeclared missing functions.",
        "current": "Full-kit documentation must expose the work, supply, support, sensing, actuation, ground-contact and route requirements it actually satisfies. No high grade grants missing anatomy.",
